 our conclusions can help guide future mutagenesis studies.","topics":[],"score":193634,"global_rank":327908},{"name":"seaaan/StatisticalInference-Coursera","owner":"seaaan","html_url":"https://github.com/seaaan/StatisticalInference-Coursera","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327910},{"name":"Purefekt/GRE-guide","owner":"Purefekt","html_url":"https://github.com/Purefekt/GRE-guide","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"\ud83d\udcda This is how i scored 327 in GRE in 30 days.","topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327912},{"name":"natetan/todolist-ios","owner":"natetan","html_url":"https://github.com/natetan/todolist-ios","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":"to do list for ios","topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327913},{"name":"henryylzhang/ext-domain-model","owner":"henryylzhang","html_url":"https://github.com/henryylzhang/ext-domain-model","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Swift","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327921},{"name":"LegenDAirie/svg_ball_size_animation_elm","owner":"LegenDAirie","html_url":"https://github.com/LegenDAirie/svg_ball_size_animation_elm","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Elm","description":"Simple SVG animation in Elm","topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327925},{"name":"viv-r/scheme-compiler","owner":"viv-r","html_url":"https://github.com/viv-r/scheme-compiler","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Haskell","description":null,"topics":[],"score":193633,"global_rank":327934},{"name":"TravisSpangle/DesktopAppNetworkRecieveMessage","owner":"TravisSpangle","html_url":"https://github.com/TravisSpangle/DesktopAppNetworkRecieveMessage","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Objective-C","description":"Desktop App that advertises a network service with Bonjour. Will l